<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26366" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δια-ψύχω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cool,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῶμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>VM</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be chilly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἄκρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Acut.</u>
					30
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>air, dry and clean,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Cont.</u>
				23
			</span></i>, etc.: metaph. of misers bringing out their hoards, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.2.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>become dry,</i> i.e. <i>unfruitful,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵνα μὴ ἡ γῆ διαψῠγῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					6.603.11
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαψήχω</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				23
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
